{"name": "DOSMIC", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/a05fcfd0c09883cf3d7f6b91c3ef7ef4.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/a05fcfd0c09883cf3d7f6b91c3ef7ef4.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/a05fcfd0c09883cf3d7f6b91c3ef7ef4.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To Nero, Snoa was the only one who was always by his side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But one day, a disaster shattered the world \u2014 and Snoa vanished without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left alone in a world overrun by towering, otherworldly beings, Nero begins his journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become Nero. Cross a strange and dangerous world in search of the missing Snoa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"23\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b0e205c76face1cf84f37175dacf2055.webp?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726 Cinematic puzzle-platformer adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726 Tense action as you slip between towering beings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726 Creative puzzles woven into the secrets of the world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726 An unknown power awakened at the edge of death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726 Abilities that evolve as your journey unfolds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2726 A story told entirely through the world \u2014 no text, no dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"23\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b0e205c76face1cf84f37175dacf2055.webp?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Bizarre, Dreamlike World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a strange and mysterious world where dark fantasy and cosmic horror intertwine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/de742f7055ecd5d36c5fe8e72c52abca.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/de742f7055ecd5d36c5fe8e72c52abca.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/de742f7055ecd5d36c5fe8e72c52abca.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Beyond the Reach of Giants</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade overwhelming beings and survive in the narrow spaces they cannot reach. Every moment counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/6d0c1e6e41b3e7e624ea9d28ef2a7f2b.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/6d0c1e6e41b3e7e624ea9d28ef2a7f2b.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/6d0c1e6e41b3e7e624ea9d28ef2a7f2b.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Secrets Woven into the World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve imaginative puzzles that are deeply tied to the hidden truths of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/e5faddb83ef7d3dbd5ba62a0c5c004d4.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/e5faddb83ef7d3dbd5ba62a0c5c004d4.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/e5faddb83ef7d3dbd5ba62a0c5c004d4.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Confront the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield a mysterious power born at the edge of death. Break through the core of these towering entities and claim what lies within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8e2878d383243801334d5e11fc1a0a7f.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8e2878d383243801334d5e11fc1a0a7f.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/8e2878d383243801334d5e11fc1a0a7f.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evolving Movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From double jumps to gliding and beyond, Nero\u2019s movement grows more fluid and precise as the journey deepens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/0d58aa85dd69ee3d4490877862c438ed.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/0d58aa85dd69ee3d4490877862c438ed.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/0d58aa85dd69ee3d4490877862c438ed.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unanswered Questions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are these beings? What is the power Nero has gained? And where is Snoa?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you move forward, the truth behind this world slowly begins to reveal itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/9bfba108b8468b787b85aad7dc0bf02f.poster.avif?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/9bfba108b8468b787b85aad7dc0bf02f.webm?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/9bfba108b8468b787b85aad7dc0bf02f.mp4?t=1781017104\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"23\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/extras/b0e205c76face1cf84f37175dacf2055.webp?t=1781017104\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Whatever awaits\u2026 keep going.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In a world crawling with colossal beings, a boy named Nero sets out on a journey to find the missing girl, Snoa. Use a variety of movement abilities and the surrounding environment to push forward, and at times confront overwhelming horrors, in this cinematic puzzle-platformer, DOSMIC.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450900/e5d3e4affaeae9979f8ea056cd8f8cb335a628ae/header.jpg?t=1781017104", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Atmospheric", "Indie", "Platformer", "Puzzle Platformer", "Puzzle", "Dark Fantasy"], "developers": "Black Cheeze", "publishers": "Black Cheeze", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3450900", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "6 September 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/1K6jXmh7hdM", "first_seen": 1757116800.0, "review_rank": 1496}